{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40022","headline":"蝴蝶二首 二 · 徐夤","name":"蝴蝶二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂绿穿红丽日长，一生心事住春光。\n最嫌神女来行雨，爱伴西施去采香。\n风定只应攒蘂粉，夜寒长是宿花房。\n鸣蝉性分殊迂阔，空解三秋噪夕阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}